flowchart TD
    UI[Streamlit game] --> T[Recorded turn or demo case]
    CLI[CLI demo] --> T
    T --> V[Input validation]
    V --> D[Deterministic Python check]
    D --> R[TF-IDF-like token retrieval]
    R --> M[Language model JSON]
    M --> O[Output validation]
    O -->|invalid once| Repair[Bounded repair]
    Repair --> O
    O -->|valid| Result[Investigation result]
    O -->|second failure/API error| F[Clearly labeled deterministic fallback]
    Result --> UI
    F --> UI
